The upstream project declares `license="MIT"` in
`META-INF/neoforge.mods.toml` of `bwncr-neoforge-1.21.1-3.20.4.jar`; it
publishes no LICENSE file or copyright line of its own. The copyright line
above names the authors from the jar's `authors` field. The port is a
clean-room Rust rewrite; no Java source or asset is translated (the carried
`.hmod` holds the mod's own lang files, MIT).
